data: {"id": "6ff836bb74984594-thinking-parallel_evidence-1055", "run_id": "6ff836bb74984594", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 4. 证据汇总与结论\n\n## 4.1 支持 `SandboxCreateFailed` 的证据 (关键发现)\n\n1.  **Events**: `FailedCreatePodSandBox` (kubelet) 事件，Message 明确指出:\n    > `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`\n2.  **Pod Spec**: Pod 包含注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`，但对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中**不存在**。\n3.  **Multus CNI 行为**: 由于 Multus 找不到指定的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition，CNI 插件无法配置 Pod 网络，导致 kubelet 反复尝试创建 Pod sandbox 失败。\n4.  **Topology**: Po", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788779873975, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

