data: {"id": "6ff836bb74984594-final", "run_id": "6ff836bb74984594", "seq": 1060, "ts_ms": 1788779892574, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx (aiops-case-05) stuck in ContainerCreating/Pending state; kubelet FailedCreatePodSandBox errors due to Multus CNI failure. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | multus | `Warning NoNetworkFound ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-05a0792bb99d) | 明确指出 Multus 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络附件定义。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox ... Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error ... plugin type=\"multus\" ... failed (add)` (fact-2bc04167ce3f) | 直接证据，kubelet 因 Multus 网络插件配置失败而无法创建 Pod 沙箱。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container: \"app\", reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` (fact-8d883e50ad91) | 确认 Pod 处于创建中状态，等待网络或其他资源就绪。 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` (fact-a9ecf2b39af6) | 从指标层面验证 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，与事件状态一致。 |\n\n上述事件证据显示，Multus 插件多次报告找不到 `unavailable-network` 网络配置，导致 kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱。指标进一步证实了容器持续处于等待创建状态。两者共同指向网络配置缺失导致的启动阻塞。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 注解引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件在命名空间 'aiops-case-05' 中查找代理失败 → Kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱（FailedCreatePodSandBox） → Pod 停留在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod 的注解引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n这一缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在执行网络配置时无法找到对应的代理，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，最终使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。证据编号 1、2、3 均直接支持这一结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 45.9s (Evidence 36.2s, RCA 9.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 79.379, "metrics": {"run_id": "6ff836bb74984594", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 79.38560009002686, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 79385.60009002686, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62643.5272693634, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1,